+ * the OPEN gate word while this module believes it is closed. The open path
+ * then refused the word as a foreign revision (it only accepted ORIG), so the
+ * clock was never raised: the restored gate still ran, busy frames did not fit
+ * a field at 100%, and the game sat at 30 with the mode reporting itself on.
+ *
